  "title": "· In Focus | Saint Laurent Unveils Summer 2027 Womenswear Collection: Anthony Vaccarello's Farewell Show ·",
  "original_title": "视野 | Saint Laurent 发布2027夏季女士系列：Anthony Vaccarello 告别秀",
  "excerpt": "Saint Laurent's Summer 2027 Paris show featured Anthony Vaccarello's \"Golden Age\" theme, reimagining classic silhouettes in luxurious gold materials.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-10-12",
  "date_label": "October 12, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ydwruxj/3c13e569166d5bac.jpg",
  "tags": [
