  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Saint Laurent's Summer 2027 womenswear show has just drawn to a close in Paris. This season's collection takes \"Golden Age\" as its theme, with creative director Anthony Vaccarello reinterpreting signature silhouettes — safari wear, trench coats, wrap skirts, broad-shouldered coats and bomber jackets — in strokes of gold. Through an array of materials including lame, organza, embossed lace, brocade and gold-leafed latex, he lends each piece a gilded radiance, letting classic shapes bloom with an otherworldly allure.",
      "url": null,
