    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This season's show coincides with the tenth anniversary of creative director Anthony Vaccarello's arrival — and marks his final collection for the house. On October 9, Kering officially announced that Vaccarello will step down from his role as creative director of Saint Laurent.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ydwruxj/a0d30ee45b4897d3.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ydwruxj/7227aa6cb70a24af.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A light shines all the more brightly because we know it cannot be held. What passes sometimes leaves more light than what remains. ——Anthony Vaccarello",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Of the collection's 59 looks, 49 are built on a gold foundation. Whether deep gold, Byzantine gold, pale gold, Renaissance gold, matte gold, Art Deco gold, brilliant gold, or a modernist — even almost brutalist — gold, this magical, oracular color haunts every silhouette, reinterpreting the aesthetic of \"the power of repetition.\"",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ydwruxj/c0bf1a8deb5c0c38.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ydwruxj/1fce20fd90789387.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I love gold; it's a magical color. When reflecting a woman, it's the color of the sun. ——Yves Saint Laurent",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
