    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From the safari wear, trench coats, shirts and wrap skirts of Mr. Yves Saint Laurent's era to Vaccarello's newly conceived house classics — broad-shouldered coats, relaxed bomber jackets, and sharply tailored short suits trimmed with generous fur — every piece is reimagined by Vaccarello through a gilded lens.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
