    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "By the finale, gold recedes into black, gathering back all the light it has refracted. Velvet suits fastened with jeweled buttons embody the quintessence of Saint Laurent, while three nimbus-black evening gowns — free in structure and brimming with vitality — reflect Vaccarello's Belgian roots, bringing the show to a perfect close.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
